    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n22587" root="شغو and شغى" body-key="$">
    
      2 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَشْغِيَةٌ</span></b>  signifies The <i>dribbling of the urine,</i>
(Lth, K, TA,) <i>little by little.</i> (Lth, TA.) One
says of a man, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شَغَّى</span>, (TK,) and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بِبَوْلِهِ</span> ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اشغى</span></b> ,
(IAth, TA,) <i>He dribbled his urine,</i> (IAth, TA,
TK,) <i>little by little.</i> (IAth, TA.)

